      "renderedContent": "<div class=\"max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-8 md:px-20 pt-20 md:pt-32 mb-16 md:mb-24\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-3xl reveal\">\n        <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold tracking-widest-xl uppercase text-gray-400 mb-6 block\">Introduction</span>\n        <h1 class=\"font-heading text-6xl md:text-9xl font-bold tracking-ultra-tight leading-tight-08 mb-8 uppercase\">ABOUT</h1>\n        <p class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed font-light\">Defining digital boundaries through a lens of minimalism and precision. Crafting interfaces that feel as good as they look.</p>\n    </div>\n</div>"
